{# What is this report #}
<div class="mb-12" data-reveal>
  <h2 class="mb-5 text-[26px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight text-[#111827] md:text-[30px]">What is this report?</h2>
  <p class="mb-5 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] md:text-[17px]">
    <strong class="font-semibold text-[#111827]">The State of AI in Nepal 2026</strong> is the first comprehensive analysis of artificial intelligence adoption across Nepali industries. Based on research from 50+ organizations in Kathmandu and beyond, this report provides actionable insights for business leaders planning AI investments.
  </p>
  <p class="text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] md:text-[17px]">
    Nepal ranks 150th globally in AI readiness, yet adoption is accelerating. Only 31.8% of businesses have dedicated AI budgets, and 56% cite lack of skilled manpower as their primary barrier. This report bridges the knowledge gap with practical frameworks tailored for Nepal's market conditions.
  </p>
</div>

{# Key Findings #}
<div class="mb-12" data-reveal>
  <h2 class="mb-6 text-[26px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight text-[#111827] md:text-[30px]">Key findings</h2>
  <div class="space-y-4">
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-navy-100/60 bg-white p-5 shadow-subtle sm:p-6">
      <div class="mb-1.5 flex items-start gap-2.5">
        <span class="mt-[0.55em] h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#76B900]" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <p class="text-[16px] font-medium leading-snug text-[#111827] sm:text-[17px]">Only 20.77% of Nepal industries are AI-ready</p>
      </div>
      <p class="pl-4 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280]">The technology sector leads at 45%, while manufacturing lags at 8%.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-navy-100/60 bg-white p-5 shadow-subtle sm:p-6">
      <div class="mb-1.5 flex items-start gap-2.5">
        <span class="mt-[0.55em] h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#76B900]" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <p class="text-[16px] font-medium leading-snug text-[#111827] sm:text-[17px]">39 AI companies operate in Nepal</p>
      </div>
      <p class="pl-4 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280]">Up from 12 in 2023, with 4 new startups founded in 2025 alone.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-navy-100/60 bg-white p-5 shadow-subtle sm:p-6">
      <div class="mb-1.5 flex items-start gap-2.5">
        <span class="mt-[0.55em] h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#76B900]" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <p class="text-[16px] font-medium leading-snug text-[#111827] sm:text-[17px]">NPR 50K to 50M investment range</p>
      </div>
      <p class="pl-4 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280]">Budget varies widely based on use case, from chatbots to full automation.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

