{# FAQ Section #}
<div class="mt-10 p-6 bg-gray-50 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 shadow-[0_1px_2px_0_rgba(15,23,42,0.04)]" data-reveal><h2 class="mt-10 mb-4 text-[22px] font-semibold leading-[36px] tracking-tight text-[#111827]">Frequently asked questions</h2><div class="space-y-6"><div><p class="mt-6 mb-2 text-[18px] font-medium leading-[1.625] text-[#4a636e]">What industries does the report cover?</p><p class="my-6 text-[18px] leading-[1.625] text-[#4a636e]">The report analyzes AI adoption across IT/Software, Financial Services, Healthcare, Manufacturing, Education, and Retail sectors in Nepal. Each industry section includes adoption rates, common use cases, and budget benchmarks.</p></div><div><p class="mt-6 mb-2 text-[18px] font-medium leading-[1.625] text-[#4a636e]">Is this report relevant for small businesses?</p><p class="my-6 text-[18px] leading-[1.625] text-[#4a636e]">Yes. We include specific guidance for SMEs with budget tiers starting at NPR 50,000. The report covers both enterprise AI implementations and accessible solutions for smaller organizations.</p></div><div><p class="mt-6 mb-2 text-[18px] font-medium leading-[1.625] text-[#4a636e]">How was the research conducted?</p><p class="my-6 text-[18px] leading-[1.625] text-[#4a636e]">We surveyed 50+ organizations across Nepal, conducted interviews with 15 technology leaders, and analyzed publicly available data from government sources, industry associations, and international AI readiness indexes.</p></div></div></div>

